1
00:00:39,828 --> 00:00:45,664
=My Loong=

2
00:00:46,004 --> 00:00:48,480
=Episode 19=

3
00:00:49,079 --> 00:00:49,840
Let go of me!

4
00:00:51,119 --> 00:00:52,000
Let go!

5
00:00:55,359 --> 00:00:56,200
Father,

6
00:00:56,759 --> 00:00:57,799
my wife is gone!

7
00:00:58,000 --> 00:00:59,159
Can't I even hang out?

8
00:01:00,560 --> 00:01:03,240
You idiot, do you still
not see the mess we're in?

9
00:01:05,120 --> 00:01:06,239
The Emperor spared me

10
00:01:06,560 --> 00:01:07,840
and let me check General's Manor.

11
00:01:09,120 --> 00:01:10,760
He's putting me right on the hot seat!

12
00:01:11,159 --> 00:01:13,280
No matter what I do,
the General's Manor and Prince Qi

13
00:01:13,879 --> 00:01:15,719
will both think I've betrayed them.

14
00:01:17,000 --> 00:01:18,760
Once the Emperor uncovers something,

15
00:01:19,040 --> 00:01:20,519
they will immediately

16
00:01:20,840 --> 00:01:22,280
make me take the fall!

17
00:01:25,359 --> 00:01:27,239
After all, I already got involved.

18
00:01:28,519 --> 00:01:30,319
On top of that, Yue Xingyao

19
00:01:31,760 --> 00:01:33,239
must be digging through records

20
00:01:34,439 --> 00:01:36,719
for evidence I overlooked.

21
00:01:37,799 --> 00:01:39,079
I tore out those pages,

22
00:01:39,640 --> 00:01:40,760
but what if...?

23
00:01:40,920 --> 00:01:41,439
My Lord!

24
00:01:42,159 --> 00:01:42,959
Terrible news!

25
00:01:43,239 --> 00:01:44,239
Yue Xingyao

26
00:01:44,640 --> 00:01:47,079
is digging into the torn pages
from the medical notes!

27
00:01:54,879 --> 00:01:55,599
Useless trash!

28
00:01:56,319 --> 00:01:58,159
Leaving evidence behind was bad enough,

29
00:01:58,359 --> 00:02:00,079
yet he actually tore out specific pages!

30
00:02:00,840 --> 00:02:03,319
Could he make his guilt
any more obvious?

31
00:02:06,799 --> 00:02:09,159
This could bring the sky down.

32
00:02:09,759 --> 00:02:12,599
We can't let her keep digging!

33
00:02:17,639 --> 00:02:18,400
When the day comes,

34
00:02:18,919 --> 00:02:20,319
the bride's brother must carry her

35
00:02:20,719 --> 00:02:23,560
from her chamber into the bridal sedan.

36
00:02:25,120 --> 00:02:26,800
It signifies a loving farewell

37
00:02:27,400 --> 00:02:28,280
and best wishes.

38
00:02:30,919 --> 00:02:31,759
Princess Hexi

39
00:02:31,960 --> 00:02:33,319
has no brother here,

40
00:02:33,560 --> 00:02:36,120
so I may perform this rite
on His Majesty's behalf.

41
00:02:42,639 --> 00:02:44,240
Of course, though rules are fixed,

42
00:02:45,800 --> 00:02:46,560
we can change them.

43
00:02:47,319 --> 00:02:48,479
This rite can be waived.

44
00:02:48,719 --> 00:02:49,280
Definitely.

45
00:02:52,360 --> 00:02:53,599
All this tedious etiquette

46
00:02:53,599 --> 00:02:54,719
gives me a headache.

47
00:02:55,120 --> 00:02:55,919
Lizhi,

48
00:02:56,400 --> 00:02:57,360
if you wish to learn,

49
00:02:57,759 --> 00:02:59,199
study with Master Wei Xun.

50
00:03:00,080 --> 00:03:00,704
All right.

51
00:03:01,319 --> 00:03:02,039
I'm leaving.

52
00:03:09,560 --> 00:03:11,039
Why are there so many rules?

53
00:03:17,159 --> 00:03:17,919
In this world,

54
00:03:18,319 --> 00:03:19,199
many rules

55
00:03:19,800 --> 00:03:20,719
are called etiquette,

56
00:03:21,159 --> 00:03:22,159
yet serve as shackles.

57
00:03:22,560 --> 00:03:24,520
They divide people into rigid classes

58
00:03:24,520 --> 00:03:25,960
and bind them in invisible chains.

59
00:03:26,520 --> 00:03:27,560
People are totally trapped

60
00:03:27,919 --> 00:03:28,680
from birth.

61
00:03:30,199 --> 00:03:32,280
Women are confined
by submission and virtue.

62
00:03:32,680 --> 00:03:34,680
Men are pressured to achieve glory.

63
00:03:35,280 --> 00:03:37,000
Farmers are tied to the soil,

64
00:03:37,000 --> 00:03:39,039
and merchants are looked down upon.

65
00:03:39,960 --> 00:03:41,159
It looks orderly,

66
00:03:42,000 --> 00:03:44,120
yet beneath it all, everyone suffocates

67
00:03:44,439 --> 00:03:45,240
under pressure.

68
00:03:46,039 --> 00:03:46,560
That is why

69
00:03:48,039 --> 00:03:49,599
I want to build a new world

70
00:03:51,000 --> 00:03:53,159
where women can establish themselves

71
00:03:53,159 --> 00:03:54,800
rather than depending on men,

72
00:03:55,360 --> 00:03:56,639
where farmers have land to till,

73
00:03:56,840 --> 00:03:57,879
where merchants get respect,

74
00:03:58,319 --> 00:03:59,560
where all live with dignity,

75
00:03:59,560 --> 00:04:01,800
and where no one is crushed by tyranny.

76
00:04:07,360 --> 00:04:08,439
Such a world

77
00:04:09,240 --> 00:04:10,000
sounds wonderful.

78
00:04:16,439 --> 00:04:18,279
These are all exquisite fabrics.

79
00:04:19,319 --> 00:04:21,000
This one for Wangshu's wedding quilt.

80
00:04:30,879 --> 00:04:31,639
Wangshu,

81
00:04:32,079 --> 00:04:32,879
why did you come?

82
00:04:33,360 --> 00:04:34,360
I can pick it myself.

83
00:04:34,759 --> 00:04:36,439
I trust your taste, of course.

84
00:04:37,839 --> 00:04:38,519
Shopkeeper,

85
00:04:39,040 --> 00:04:39,759
leave us alone.

86
00:04:39,759 --> 00:04:40,680
We'll browse ourselves.

87
00:04:41,959 --> 00:04:43,639
For my big day,

88
00:04:44,439 --> 00:04:47,000
I definitely need the finest fabric.

89
00:04:47,399 --> 00:04:48,240
How about this one?

90
00:04:49,399 --> 00:04:50,199
- Wangshu.
- How about this?

91
00:04:51,040 --> 00:04:51,639
Leave now.

92
00:04:53,519 --> 00:04:54,560
I'm afraid we can't.

93
00:04:57,120 --> 00:04:58,160
Master Wei Xun

94
00:04:58,399 --> 00:05:00,839
always keeps guards watching over you,

95
00:05:01,120 --> 00:05:02,519
yet they vanished today.

96
00:05:02,519 --> 00:05:03,199
Xingyao,

97
00:05:03,959 --> 00:05:04,839
what are you planning?

98
00:05:05,120 --> 00:05:06,079
You know

99
00:05:06,800 --> 00:05:08,800
I could never miss
that you were in danger.

100
00:05:09,439 --> 00:05:10,120
Besides,

101
00:05:10,439 --> 00:05:11,720
your bait is too small

102
00:05:12,360 --> 00:05:13,759
to catch a big fish.

103
00:05:29,920 --> 00:05:31,199
I told you to invite them over!

104
00:05:32,240 --> 00:05:33,120
What is this?

105
00:05:33,720 --> 00:05:34,839
Did you get hurt?

106
00:05:36,000 --> 00:05:37,920
If anything happens to these two ladies

107
00:05:38,240 --> 00:05:39,160
and His Majesty knows,

108
00:05:39,319 --> 00:05:41,680
I'll definitely be dead!

109
00:05:45,199 --> 00:05:46,160
Are you all right?

110
00:05:46,399 --> 00:05:47,720
Please be okay.

111
00:05:47,839 --> 00:05:48,480
Lord Zhang,

112
00:05:49,800 --> 00:05:51,720
did you really think
you could play both sides?

113
00:05:52,639 --> 00:05:53,839
You didn't kidnap us

114
00:05:54,040 --> 00:05:55,000
for Prince Qi,

115
00:05:55,199 --> 00:05:56,279
nor for the Yue family.

116
00:05:56,839 --> 00:05:57,560
You're just afraid

117
00:05:58,000 --> 00:06:00,120
that if the Emperor and Prince Qi clash,

118
00:06:00,600 --> 00:06:02,079
you'll be the first pawn sacrificed.

119
00:06:02,560 --> 00:06:03,240
By capturing us,

120
00:06:03,800 --> 00:06:05,759
you plan to sit on the fence.

121
00:06:06,160 --> 00:06:07,240
Once the dust settles,

122
00:06:07,519 --> 00:06:08,480
you'll go to the victor.

123
00:06:09,319 --> 00:06:10,439
Have you ever considered

124
00:06:10,920 --> 00:06:12,399
whether Jiang Liuying would let you?

125
00:06:12,720 --> 00:06:13,600
To her,

126
00:06:13,879 --> 00:06:15,079
the best end for you

127
00:06:15,319 --> 00:06:17,079
is dying right here with us.

128
00:06:19,920 --> 00:06:20,759
Stop looking around.

129
00:06:22,399 --> 00:06:23,480
Her assassins

130
00:06:24,120 --> 00:06:25,360
are likely already in position,

131
00:06:26,360 --> 00:06:27,560
waiting to claim your life.

132
00:07:06,560 --> 00:07:08,120
Lizhi, leave him alive!

133
00:07:15,319 --> 00:07:16,160
- Are you okay?
- Are you hurt?

134
00:07:21,560 --> 00:07:22,160
Are you okay?

135
00:07:30,560 --> 00:07:31,120
Tell me.

136
00:07:32,120 --> 00:07:33,199
You set up such a trap

137
00:07:33,519 --> 00:07:34,839
to bait her to silence Zhang Fan.

138
00:07:35,360 --> 00:07:36,439
What is this really about?

139
00:07:37,120 --> 00:07:38,560
Did you find out something recently?

140
00:07:40,360 --> 00:07:41,600
I'm your sister.

141
00:07:42,600 --> 00:07:43,160
Is there

142
00:07:43,600 --> 00:07:44,920
anything you can't tell me?

143
00:07:59,199 --> 00:08:00,120
This is...

144
00:08:04,563 --> 00:08:05,408
(Medical Notes)

145
00:08:12,959 --> 00:08:13,600
Look.

146
00:08:14,160 --> 00:08:14,800
These pages

147
00:08:14,800 --> 00:08:16,240
were clearly torn out in a hurry.

148
00:08:17,519 --> 00:08:18,959
When Mother treated palace staff,

149
00:08:19,519 --> 00:08:20,680
the late Emperor died abruptly,

150
00:08:20,959 --> 00:08:21,800
capital in chaos.

151
00:08:22,199 --> 00:08:23,000
I wonder

152
00:08:23,759 --> 00:08:25,399
if Father and Mother were murdered

153
00:08:27,319 --> 00:08:28,600
back then.

154
00:08:30,639 --> 00:08:31,439
That makes sense.

155
00:08:33,080 --> 00:08:34,480
Mother was a skilled physician

156
00:08:34,480 --> 00:08:35,559
and was in good health.

157
00:08:35,960 --> 00:08:37,000
How could she and Father

158
00:08:37,399 --> 00:08:39,159
both fall ill suddenly and die together?

159
00:08:43,559 --> 00:08:45,159
Zhang Fan knows he was a discarded pawn,

160
00:08:45,840 --> 00:08:47,360
so he won't dare hide anything now.

161
00:08:48,039 --> 00:08:50,320
Lady Xingyao is quite wise,

162
00:08:50,720 --> 00:08:51,759
bold, and meticulous.

163
00:08:53,240 --> 00:08:53,920
Move.

164
00:08:54,480 --> 00:08:55,168
Move.

165
00:09:02,039 --> 00:09:02,799
This is the man

166
00:09:02,799 --> 00:09:04,279
you sent to protect the sisters.

167
00:09:04,440 --> 00:09:05,960
Yet he deliberately left,

168
00:09:05,960 --> 00:09:07,519
giving the enemy their chance.

169
00:09:07,679 --> 00:09:08,559
You misunderstand.

170
00:09:09,240 --> 00:09:10,080
This operation

171
00:09:10,080 --> 00:09:11,960
was planned between Lady Xingyao and me.

172
00:09:11,960 --> 00:09:13,200
I never wanted her in danger,

173
00:09:13,919 --> 00:09:15,159
but she insisted.

174
00:09:15,720 --> 00:09:16,799
Everyone knew my men

175
00:09:17,120 --> 00:09:18,120
were protecting her.

176
00:09:18,559 --> 00:09:20,120
If they hadn't staged negligence,

177
00:09:20,600 --> 00:09:21,960
the enemy wouldn't have been fooled.

178
00:09:22,159 --> 00:09:22,799
In truth,

179
00:09:23,279 --> 00:09:25,200
we were both watching over them
from the shadows,

180
00:09:25,759 --> 00:09:27,000
ensuring they were safe.

181
00:09:33,159 --> 00:09:35,159
- Your...
- Your men weren't just guarding them.

182
00:09:36,039 --> 00:09:38,639
They were tracking every detail
of her daily routine.

183
00:09:40,679 --> 00:09:41,200
Stand down.

184
00:09:41,559 --> 00:09:42,080
Stand down.

185
00:09:46,679 --> 00:09:47,480
Master Lizhi,

186
00:09:47,840 --> 00:09:48,639
at this point,

187
00:09:49,039 --> 00:09:50,360
it's time for me to be frank.

188
00:09:51,399 --> 00:09:52,840
I am the reigning Emperor.

189
00:09:59,559 --> 00:10:00,639
Even learning my identity,

190
00:10:00,799 --> 00:10:01,799
you show no surprise.

191
00:10:02,440 --> 00:10:04,000
You truly are extraordinary.

192
00:10:04,240 --> 00:10:05,480
I took such steps

193
00:10:05,960 --> 00:10:07,159
because of you.

194
00:10:07,159 --> 00:10:08,360
Though I am the Emperor,

195
00:10:08,960 --> 00:10:10,360
I ascended the throne as a child.

196
00:10:10,799 --> 00:10:12,120
The court has been controlled

197
00:10:12,120 --> 00:10:13,960
by my uncle, Prince Qi, for years.

198
00:10:14,440 --> 00:10:15,720
If he made the state prosper,

199
00:10:16,399 --> 00:10:17,440
I wouldn't care.

200
00:10:17,879 --> 00:10:20,080
Yet traveling across the land,

201
00:10:20,960 --> 00:10:23,960
I saw only tyranny,
corruption, and human sacrifices.

202
00:10:24,279 --> 00:10:26,000
The country was never meant
to be this way.

203
00:10:27,000 --> 00:10:27,960
I need your power,

204
00:10:27,960 --> 00:10:28,600
Master Lizhi.

205
00:10:29,919 --> 00:10:31,559
I know you are no ordinary mortal,

206
00:10:32,639 --> 00:10:34,519
but if you are willing to aid me,

207
00:10:34,759 --> 00:10:36,879
the entire country
will be grateful to you.

208
00:10:43,679 --> 00:10:44,840
Why were you tracking her?

209
00:10:48,559 --> 00:10:49,720
Lady Xingyao

210
00:10:49,720 --> 00:10:52,120
ate osmanthus cake today.
She has a sweet tooth.

211
00:10:52,120 --> 00:10:54,639
Lady Xingyao bought vests today.

212
00:10:54,960 --> 00:10:55,639
Lady Xingyao

213
00:10:55,919 --> 00:10:57,399
bought vests. She likes lake blue.

214
00:10:58,240 --> 00:11:00,399
Lady Xingyao likes...

215
00:11:00,399 --> 00:11:01,639
Haven't you figured it out now?

216
00:11:01,840 --> 00:11:02,399
Xingyao...

217
00:11:02,399 --> 00:11:03,840
How did a fool like you get betrothed?

218
00:11:05,399 --> 00:11:06,519
- Give it back!
- Lady Xingyao...

219
00:11:07,360 --> 00:11:08,064
Give it back!

220
00:11:14,919 --> 00:11:16,120
- Long live Your Majesty.
- Long live Your Majesty.

221
00:11:18,120 --> 00:11:19,039
Please rise.

222
00:11:20,039 --> 00:11:22,519
How did you discover who I am?

223
00:11:26,440 --> 00:11:27,600
Before my father died,

224
00:11:27,919 --> 00:11:29,120
he was in good health.

225
00:11:29,519 --> 00:11:30,440
He abruptly fell ill,

226
00:11:31,360 --> 00:11:32,200
and the physicians

227
00:11:32,679 --> 00:11:33,840
suspected a severe cold.

228
00:11:34,919 --> 00:11:36,000
I went to visit him

229
00:11:36,159 --> 00:11:37,000
and fell ill as well.

230
00:11:37,519 --> 00:11:38,240
I almost

231
00:11:38,879 --> 00:11:40,000
went down with my father.

232
00:11:40,240 --> 00:11:42,440
Your Majesty, do you recall

233
00:11:42,440 --> 00:11:43,759
if he took any unusual medicine

234
00:11:43,759 --> 00:11:45,240
before his condition worsened?

235
00:11:45,600 --> 00:11:46,720
Unusual medicine?

236
00:11:47,080 --> 00:11:47,639
I remember

237
00:11:48,240 --> 00:11:49,559
the physicians gave us

238
00:11:49,559 --> 00:11:50,840
something called Yushu Ointment.

239
00:11:51,159 --> 00:11:52,279
Yushu Ointment?

240
00:11:57,559 --> 00:11:58,600
Yushu Ointment

241
00:11:58,840 --> 00:11:59,440
is harmless,

242
00:11:59,879 --> 00:12:01,759
with no bad reactions
to common medicine.

243
00:12:02,480 --> 00:12:04,360
However, when combined

244
00:12:04,360 --> 00:12:05,960
with a specific herb, it...

245
00:12:07,399 --> 00:12:08,039
What herb?

246
00:12:08,559 --> 00:12:10,279
Taken with Baiyingzhi Herb,

247
00:12:10,559 --> 00:12:11,879
it shows no immediate symptoms,

248
00:12:12,200 --> 00:12:14,039
instead boosting one's energy.

249
00:12:14,240 --> 00:12:15,440
Over time, however,

250
00:12:15,720 --> 00:12:18,279
it slowly rots the vital organs,

251
00:12:18,639 --> 00:12:20,200
ending in death by total exhaustion.

252
00:12:20,720 --> 00:12:22,840
It looks identical to a sudden illness,

253
00:12:23,200 --> 00:12:24,159
nearly undetectable.

254
00:12:25,759 --> 00:12:27,639
Your Majesty, do you remember

255
00:12:27,840 --> 00:12:30,120
who presented that remedy
to the physicians?

256
00:12:31,519 --> 00:12:32,399
Your aunt.

257
00:12:33,360 --> 00:12:34,440
So that's how it happened.

258
00:12:35,799 --> 00:12:37,919
Mother entered the palace
to treat the late Emperor.

259
00:12:38,759 --> 00:12:40,120
She must have uncovered the truth,

260
00:12:40,919 --> 00:12:42,080
which is why they killed her!

261
00:12:43,720 --> 00:12:45,120
Father died because of it too.

262
00:12:59,879 --> 00:13:00,600
Back then,

263
00:13:01,159 --> 00:13:02,799
I was given the same medicine.

264
00:13:03,799 --> 00:13:05,200
They intended to kill me

265
00:13:05,679 --> 00:13:06,799
along with my father.

266
00:13:07,559 --> 00:13:11,240
Yet someone made me stop taking it.

267
00:13:12,360 --> 00:13:13,320
The one who saved me

268
00:13:17,159 --> 00:13:18,559
was your mother.

269
00:13:29,000 --> 00:13:31,240
Your Majesty, it's a misunderstanding!

270
00:13:32,600 --> 00:13:34,200
Spare me your excuses, Zhang Fan.

271
00:13:34,519 --> 00:13:36,279
I'll be blunt with you.

272
00:13:36,840 --> 00:13:37,679
Keeping you

273
00:13:38,039 --> 00:13:39,440
on this case was just to show you

274
00:13:39,440 --> 00:13:41,559
that Prince Qi and Jiang Liuying

275
00:13:41,759 --> 00:13:43,799
merely see you as an expendable pawn.

276
00:13:43,799 --> 00:13:45,159
If I hadn't stepped in,

277
00:13:45,600 --> 00:13:46,519
not just you,

278
00:13:46,639 --> 00:13:48,679
but your entire family would have died.

279
00:13:48,840 --> 00:13:49,360
He wouldn't

280
00:13:49,720 --> 00:13:51,039
even spare my family?

281
00:13:51,600 --> 00:13:52,720
Confess everything,

282
00:13:53,519 --> 00:13:54,559
and I'll protect your family

283
00:13:55,039 --> 00:13:56,559
and leave your body intact.

284
00:14:01,639 --> 00:14:02,960
It was Prince Qi!

285
00:14:03,399 --> 00:14:04,879
Prince Qi worked with Jiang Liuying.

286
00:14:05,320 --> 00:14:07,360
They used the Baiyingzhi Herb

287
00:14:07,879 --> 00:14:10,720
to make you and the late Emperor
show cold symptoms.

288
00:14:10,720 --> 00:14:13,000
Then they used the Yushu Ointment
from Madam Jiang,

289
00:14:13,200 --> 00:14:14,240
claiming it would

290
00:14:14,399 --> 00:14:15,919
nurse both of you back to health.

291
00:14:15,919 --> 00:14:17,360
In truth, it was a lethal poison!

292
00:14:17,720 --> 00:14:19,080
It was Madam Yue

293
00:14:19,080 --> 00:14:20,919
who found out
and secretly swapped your medicine,

294
00:14:20,919 --> 00:14:21,840
saving your life.

295
00:14:22,720 --> 00:14:24,440
But that tipped them off.

296
00:14:24,720 --> 00:14:26,600
Terrified of exposure, Madam Jiang and I

297
00:14:26,960 --> 00:14:29,039
bribed an infected refugee

298
00:14:29,399 --> 00:14:30,679
while General Yue and his wife

299
00:14:30,679 --> 00:14:32,000
were providing disaster relief.

300
00:14:32,600 --> 00:14:35,679
They knew the couple's compassion

301
00:14:35,960 --> 00:14:36,799
would drive them

302
00:14:37,639 --> 00:14:38,799
to personally treat the sick.

303
00:14:39,399 --> 00:14:41,600
They exploited their kindness,

304
00:14:41,759 --> 00:14:43,279
infecting them with the deadly plague

305
00:14:43,559 --> 00:14:45,360
until they succumbed to it!

306
00:14:52,800 --> 00:14:54,400
(Daizhou Yamen)

307
00:15:09,759 --> 00:15:10,840
Thinking of your parents?

308
00:15:11,559 --> 00:15:12,639
The past cannot be undone,

309
00:15:13,759 --> 00:15:14,480
but blood debts

310
00:15:15,360 --> 00:15:16,240
must be repaid.

311
00:15:17,159 --> 00:15:17,759
Besides,

312
00:15:18,919 --> 00:15:21,600
I'm not alone anymore, am I?

313
00:15:39,159 --> 00:15:40,120
It's snowing.

314
00:15:45,799 --> 00:15:47,919
My Lord, could you do me a favor

315
00:15:48,360 --> 00:15:49,519
and make it stop?

316
00:15:50,320 --> 00:15:50,912
Sure.

317
00:16:01,120 --> 00:16:01,960
Why hasn't it stopped?

318
00:16:02,799 --> 00:16:04,519
Did your magic fail?

319
00:16:06,240 --> 00:16:06,919
No.

320
00:16:07,919 --> 00:16:08,960
Didn't you warn me

321
00:16:08,960 --> 00:16:10,240
not to misuse my power?

322
00:16:11,039 --> 00:16:11,840
It's heaven's will.

323
00:16:13,200 --> 00:16:15,120
Perhaps heaven is telling us...

324
00:16:16,320 --> 00:16:17,080
You wish.

325
00:16:17,320 --> 00:16:18,000
Let's go home.

326
00:16:32,244 --> 00:16:36,819
♪Bridal red blankets
ninety-nine miles of frost♪

327
00:16:37,594 --> 00:16:42,091
♪She looks back,
wind and rain veiling the moon♪

328
00:16:45,330 --> 00:16:50,452
♪Beneath the abyss, golden eyes open♪

329
00:16:50,452 --> 00:16:53,791
♪A thousand-year trial
scorches the soul♪

330
00:16:53,791 --> 00:16:55,155
♪Refusing to forget♪

331
00:16:58,821 --> 00:17:03,598
♪The mortal world's rules
are cruel and absurd♪

332
00:17:04,149 --> 00:17:05,939
♪He cannot learn them♪

333
00:17:05,939 --> 00:17:09,074
♪Yet carves her name upon his heart♪

334
00:17:12,226 --> 00:17:14,550
♪One name on a wooden plaque♪

335
00:17:14,550 --> 00:17:16,913
♪Swaying high upon the branch♪

336
00:17:17,491 --> 00:17:20,155
♪Waiting for snow and wind
to speak for him♪

337
00:17:20,155 --> 00:17:21,913
♪Their days ahead are long♪
